# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:69
translate italian dana3_878246f2:

    # cw "Yes, ma'am, thank you."
    cw "Sì, signora, grazie."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:71
translate italian dana3_286e8647:

    # "She quickly shuts the door and rushes away."
    "Chiude rapidamente la porta e se ne va di corsa."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:72
translate italian dana3_f0ea3fe4:

    # "She never even looked at me."
    "Non mi ha nemmeno guardato."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:73
translate italian dana3_27b21c19:

    # bs "Poor girl. I hope everything is okay."
    bs "Povera ragazza. Spero che vada tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:74
translate italian dana3_1a28adf6:

    # "It feels like work is about to become super-awkward."
    "Sembra che l’atmosfera al lavoro stia per diventare davvero imbarazzante."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:75
translate italian dana3_60f1a3d3:

    # "Why was she doing that in the file room anyways?"
    "Ma perché se ne andava in giro nell’archivio, comunque?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:76
translate italian dana3_79f7f898:

    # "I think about telling Mrs. Mills about it, but I decide I don't want to get her in trouble."
    "Penso di dirlo alla signora Mills, ma decido che non voglio metterla nei guai."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:77
translate italian dana3_fcaa87ad:

    # "I spend the rest of the day working, unable to get Dana out of my head."
    "Trascorro il resto della giornata lavorando, incapace di togliermi Dana dalla testa."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana3.rpy:78
translate italian dana3_b0a0c6bf:

    # "Until finally it is time to leave for the day. Mrs. Mills and I say our goodbyes and I go out to the car."
    "Finché finalmente arriva l’ora di andare via. Io e la signora Mills ci salutiamo e io esco verso l’auto."

